<title>UK: Brent cargo trades at May Brent -94 cents - trade.</title>
<headline>Brent cargo trades at May Brent -94 cents - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of Brent crude oil traded on Monday at a discount of 94 cents to May Brent for a minimum sized cargo, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo was one of the eight bought by Statsco from British Petroleum on Thursday and was onsold to a Wall Street refiner.</p>
<p>It was not yet clear how many of the other cargoes would be re-offered on the spot market, traders said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
